        "description": "# Beyond Putt and the Future of Mixed Reality\n\nStep into a whole new dimension with Beyond Putt, where cutting-edge Mixed Reality (MR) tech turns your living room into an epic mini-golf course. **The game adapts to your space**, creating a dynamic setup that evolves based on your surroundings. With our advanced physics engine, **every collision—whether it's with the ball or even scanned furniture**—feels incredibly real. Watch as the ball reacts to obstacles in your space, adding a new layer of immersion and strategy that takes your game to the next level. \n\nAnd if you're ready for a deeper dive, our Virtual Reality (VR) mode transports you to jaw-dropping courses that look and feel like the real deal. With ultra-realistic graphics and gameplay, you'll find yourself exploring meticulously crafted environments where every putt feels like you're on a pro mini-golf course. Navigate everything from peaceful gardens to futuristic terrains, all designed to keep you hooked and elevate your play. \n",
